# Email Queue System — Pro Gating & Smart Retries (v2)

Gate the Ofast Emailer with a 50 emails/day free tier and Smart Retries for Pro users.

---

## Critical Architecture Decision: What Counts?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **The 50/day quota ONLY counts emails sent through the Ofast Emailer module.** It does NOT affect:
> - WordPress core emails (password resets, admin notifications)
> - WooCommerce emails (order confirmations, shipping updates)
> - OTP/verification emails from any plugin
> - Any `wp_mail()` call from other plugins or themes
> - Test sends ("Send to me as test only")
>
> **Why this works:** Our quota counter is only called inside our own module code (Send tab + Processor). We never hook into the global `wp_mail` pipeline for counting. Sites with heavy notifications are completely unaffected.

**What DOES count toward 50/day:**
- Emails sent from the "Send Email" tab (both direct ≤50 and queued >50 paths)
- Background campaign batch sends from the queue processor

**Example day for a free user:**
- 9am: Send 30 emails via Emailer → counter = 30
- 10am: WooCommerce sends 200 order emails → counter still 30 (exempt)
- 11am: WordPress sends 5 password resets → counter still 30 (exempt)
- 2pm: Send 20 more via Emailer → counter = 50 (limit reached)
- 3pm: Try to send 10 more via Emailer → **blocked** with upgrade message
- Next day: counter resets to 0 automatically

