## Retry Notification Strategy

> [!NOTE]
> **Admin Notice approach** (not email notification) — because if the SMTP server is failing, sending a notification email about the failure would also fail. Admin notices are rendered server-side and always visible.

When Smart Retries are active:
- **Admin notice** on Emailer pages: `"⚡ Smart Retries: 3 emails are being retried for Campaign #42. Next attempt in 12 minutes."`
- **Campaigns tab** shows retry counts inline
- **error_log()** entries for debugging

